OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to secure 32 domestic abuse
OL,4,Arefuge spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree refuges for women and children
OL,7,Ffleeing domestic abuse are set to
OL,8,Fcontinue operating for at least another
OL,9,Fthree years.
OL,11,FCambridgeshire County Council's
OL,12,Fcommunities, social mobility and
OL,13,Finclusion committee has been asked to
OL,14,Fapprove plans to award contracts worth
OL,15,Fup to #478,000 a year.
OL,17,FThe aim is to maintain the current
OL,18,Fspace for 32 women and their children
OL,19,Facross the three centres.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
