OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to secure 32 domestic abuse
OL,4,Arefuge spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Refuges provide accommodation for
OL,7,Fthose fleeing but importantly safety
OL,8,Ffrom the perpetrator and support to
OL,9,Fmove on with their lives," a report
OL,10,Fbeing presented to the committee said.
